# Staging area for source images handed off for tile photos — each gets
# cropped into src/lib/assets/tiles/<name>.jpg, which is what's tracked
# and deployed; the full-size originals here are disposable working
# input, not a build asset (excluded so they don't ship to static/images/
# on GitHub Pages, and don't clutter `git status` as more get dropped in).
/static/images/splash/
